WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.120
Versels UISDK supplies agents with 50 behaviors for building accessible components across 5 frameworks. This is Models &amp; Agents Episode 234, then a personal glucose predictor, a tamper evident agent harness, and perplexity teammates on the MAC, with a look under the hood later. Versels Labs released the UISDK as an Apache 2.0 license beta, Mark Tech Post reports a headless library of Primitive's Agents assemble, rather than finish components.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:36.280
agents combine primitives such as create roving focus, create type-ahead, create pop-up, create selection,

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:44.140
and create reorder with adapters for React 19 plus, view 3.5 plus, svelte 5.33 plus,

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.780
solid two release candidate, and plain web components.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:53.620
In Versels Own Test, an agent completed a settings task with 69% fewer tool calls

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:57.500
and 61% less time when using the direct UI bridge.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:04.200
Pre-built examples cover select, combo box, date picker, menu, tree, and color picker, and

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.680
a prompt template is there for agents to paste so they learn the primitives.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.820
Behaviors are defined once with defined primitive and rendered identically across every

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:18.440
adapter via create parts, so one behavior definition serves all of them without duplication.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:26.160
The project ships six NPM packages at version 0.1.0 beta 1, and runs in any modern browser

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.760
with no GPU requirement.

00:01:28.675 --> 00:01:34.995
An author on the machine learning subreddit pre-trained a 31,253 parameter encoder-only

00:01:34.995 --> 00:01:42.695
transformer on 19,200 years of synthetic continuous glucose monitor, or CGM data from 1 million

00:01:42.695 --> 00:01:50.015
simulated type 1 diabetics, then use low-rank adaptation or Laura to fit 115 days of personal

00:01:50.015 --> 00:01:50.475
traces.

00:01:50.475 --> 00:01:55.615
The model predicts two hours ahead, infills missing segments, and back casts,

00:01:55.915 --> 00:02:00.935
outputting blood glucose values in covachev risk space, using combined dilate,

00:02:01.215 --> 00:02:03.335
mean-squared error, and pinball loss.

00:02:03.915 --> 00:02:08.715
It learns to predict time of day from past traces once context exceeds 48 hours,

00:02:09.115 --> 00:02:14.115
accepts insulin units and carbohydrate grams with glycemic index as action curves,

00:02:14.115 --> 00:02:20.155
Trains with learned Kendall gal weights and keeps a native variable context window of 3.5

00:02:20.155 --> 00:02:21.635
to 7.0 days.

00:02:22.135 --> 00:02:26.615
It remains weaker than the author at predicting hypoglycemia in the next 30 minutes.

00:02:27.613 --> 00:02:33.553
Bolt PCHE is a deterministic, tamper-evident safety harness that depends every agent

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:38.913
decision to a hash chain so runs can be replayed and verified after the fact instead of trusted.

00:02:39.713 --> 00:02:44.233
Episodic memory rights are checked against the chain for tampering, and the open harness

00:02:44.233 --> 00:02:47.033
records every decision into that chain as it occurs.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:53.820
The MAC app now hosts perplexity teammates, digital trends reports, persistent agents that

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:59.100
plan tasks, spawn additional agents when needed, and notify the user when work is complete.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:05.500
They take on growth campaigns, bug triage, metrics tracking, and market research, and access

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.320
requires the $200 per month MACS plan.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:12.460
agents communicate through dedicated channels, maintain their own cloud

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:17.982
instances, and continue working even after the user closes the computer. Chat

00:03:17.982 --> 00:03:23.822
GPT wallet launched by OpenAI, Eucromedia news reports, lets dots agents find

00:03:23.822 --> 00:03:28.162
products, reach checkout, and pay after the user confirms with Face ID or

00:03:28.162 --> 00:03:32.602
fingerprint. Card details stay hidden from both the agent and merchants via

00:03:32.602 --> 00:03:37.762
tokenized payments, and the service is rolling out first to select US Chat GPT

00:03:37.762 --> 00:03:40.082
pro-subscribers aged 18 and older.

00:03:40.722 --> 00:03:46.342
The system displays retailer, items, total and payment method before each biometric confirmation.

00:03:46.782 --> 00:03:51.762
Then generates a token that replaces actual card numbers and security codes while preserving

00:03:51.762 --> 00:03:53.982
existing rewards and consumer protections.

00:03:54.682 --> 00:03:57.462
Some merchants may still block automated purchases.

00:03:58.561 --> 00:04:03.381
Harm likelihood tests got 10 recommendations on anthropics engineering blog for how to

00:04:03.381 --> 00:04:09.441
design, run, and report safety evaluations that measure whether a model increases or decreases

00:04:09.441 --> 00:04:15.481
harm likelihood. The post draws on system card experience and psychology's replication reforms,

00:04:15.781 --> 00:04:21.541
stressing pre-registration, multi-expert review, and clear documentation of sampling and grading

00:04:21.541 --> 00:04:27.221
methods. It distinguishes safety evals from capability measurements, notes that evals are

00:04:27.221 --> 00:04:33.081
easy to game and hard to reproduce, and recommends involving subject matter experts alongside technical

00:04:33.081 --> 00:04:37.801
and method specialists when deciding how to sample, grade, and analyze responses.

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:45.200
TPU Sync, MarkTech Post Reports, is an open source C++ library Google released to move key

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:51.500
value caches and weights across tensor processing unit high band with memory, host DRAM, storage,

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:52.140
and network.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:05:00.080
Google reports more than 90% lower key value transfer latency on 235 billion to 480 billion

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.160
parameter mixture of experts models.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:09.401
Elsewhere, Databricks' Ken Wong argues, big-go finance reports that context not model IQ

00:05:09.401 --> 00:05:15.541
is blocking AI agents at work, because the 40-point accuracy gap on the bird benchmark disappears

00:05:15.541 --> 00:05:18.281
once company-specific term-mappings are supplied.

00:05:18.741 --> 00:05:24.721
The top 50 leaderboard entries all get Oracle term definitions and reach nearly 90%, then

00:05:24.721 --> 00:05:26.781
drop to roughly 50% without them.

00:05:26.781 --> 00:05:34.401
B.M.25 keyword search matched BGE large accuracy towards data science found on 200 tool-wret

00:05:34.401 --> 00:05:40.801
questions while running roughly 40 times faster on CPU when full tool documentation was indexed.

00:05:40.801 --> 00:05:47.261
Covering up to 3,794 tools and staying competitive with an 8 billion parameter embedding model.

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:53.840
Install the Versel UISDK beta and paste the provided prompt into your coding agent so

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:56.340
it can compose components without handwritten ARIA.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:59.740
via the Accessibility Attributes screen readers rely on.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:05.960
Clone the Bolt PCHIE repository and wrap an existing agent run to generate verifiable

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.180
hash chain receipts for audit or replay.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:12.720
Add BM25 alongside your embedding retriever for tool selection.

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.980
The CPU path is immediate on modest hardware.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:21.620
Load the personal CGM transformer from the GitHub repo and test its forecasts against your

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.280
own continuous glucose data.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:30.538
OpenAI continues a gradual rollout of chat GPT wallet to more US pro users, with expansion

00:06:30.538 --> 00:06:32.338
beyond dots agents still coming.

00:06:33.078 --> 00:06:37.658
Anthropics safety evaluation recommendations are expected to influence upcoming system

00:06:37.658 --> 00:06:38.398
card releases.

00:06:39.318 --> 00:06:43.898
Proplexity teammates on Mac may reach additional subscription tiers if usage data supports

00:06:43.898 --> 00:06:44.198
it.

00:06:45.012 --> 00:06:49.832
Pipeline parallelism looks like the way to hold an approximately 1 trillion parameter mixture

00:06:49.832 --> 00:06:54.232
of experts, so let me pop the hood on the machine learning sub-reddit run that dropped

00:06:54.232 --> 00:06:57.952
it and still hit 1,300 tokens per second per GPU.

00:06:58.652 --> 00:07:04.492
Only some expert networks fire for each token in that mixture of experts set up, and 384

00:07:04.492 --> 00:07:12.572
GH-200s ran 384-way fully-sharded data parallel, or FSDP, which shards weights across GPUs,

00:07:12.912 --> 00:07:15.792
plus 4-way expert parallelism inside each node.

00:07:15.792 --> 00:07:21.372
full activation checkpointing with grace offload, the Mewon optimizer and 8-bit

00:07:21.372 --> 00:07:25.612
floating-point expert all gathered delivered a 14 times throughput gain over

00:07:25.612 --> 00:07:30.812
the starting baseline. Newton Shull's orthogonalization moved on to the GPU and

00:07:30.812 --> 00:07:35.892
cut the optimizer step from 42 seconds to roughly two seconds. Infinity band

00:07:35.892 --> 00:07:45.772
made pipeline steps too long, so FSDP plus expert parallelism took over, and

00:07:45.772 --> 00:07:47.012
on NV-Link.

00:07:47.732 --> 00:07:49.912
Routing allocations through the compute stream

00:07:49.912 --> 00:07:52.812
freed 13.5 GB of peak memory,

00:07:53.252 --> 00:07:55.992
while group-limited routing kept expert load balance

00:07:55.992 --> 00:07:58.412
but left a small training instability risk

00:07:58.412 --> 00:07:59.432
still under measurement.

00:08:00.132 --> 00:08:02.532
The stack belongs on NV-Link heavy nodes

00:08:02.532 --> 00:08:05.072
where FSDP and expert parallelism

00:08:05.072 --> 00:08:06.632
can replace pipeline stages,

00:08:07.152 --> 00:08:09.012
and it is the wrong fit if every step

00:08:09.012 --> 00:08:10.552
still crosses infinity band,

00:08:10.732 --> 00:08:13.352
or you cannot absorb that unmeasured routing instability.

00:08:13.892 --> 00:08:19.476
Before we go, Databricks is lining up further genie data agent updates that incorporate that

00:08:19.476 --> 00:08:20.776
context mapping work.

